{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes... you're a stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not just any stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell off your tree and now you're on a journey \u2014 not just to return to your trunk, but to prove that even a lifeless piece of wood can <strong>do the impossible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce, roll and rage your way across floating furniture, garden tools, weird junk, and even industrial machinery in a physically absurd world that\u2019s constantly trying to throw you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games that hate you (but you love anyway), <strong>I Am A Stick</strong> is a brutally challenging platformer where every movement counts, and every fall hurts \u2014 emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a stick find its way home? You\u2019ll laugh, you\u2019ll scream, and maybe, just maybe... you\u2019ll find meaning in the splinters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nobody said it was easy.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3882860/f38119c8505eb86cab19ed4c0fa5790820b550a7.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome home.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3882860/eaa841a5f7af6ec22cd1ba8c5106443b4e4c5069.jpg"},{"name":"Stick Master.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3882860/08e7580d4b453f50b7c5a4cdb27e510a33b1d37b.jpg"},{"name":"Costume Master.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3882860/4eef89de6db512b0a20daff579e6cdf7e09c4a84.jpg"},{"name":"I Am A Sh*t.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3882860/286a1e30cf4270f65beeb114ac621daeae02241c.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882860?t=1759254170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steam